16 ! number of processors per mpi thread
0 ! scheme (0 = MC-PIC, 1 = EC-PIC, 2 = I-NGP)
0.2 1.0   ! time step , first is fraction of initial plasma frequency, second is actual time step in seconds, take minimum
1e-6 ! total simulation time
1e-9 ! total averaging time
20 ! number of diagnostic times
test_cpp ! save file name
../../../../Test/ ! Save directory relative path
no ! Restart(yes/no) and save directory to take from
END

